### Menú
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pizzas

### Crear pedido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"pizzaId":1,"quantity":2},{"pizzaId":2,"quantity":1}]}

### Cambiar estado
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"EN_PREPARACION"}

### Ejecutar reporte
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batch/sales-report?date=2026-10-22
